Z||000000||Raydar||12-08-2001||11:19 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cookie4b.jpg"> <P>Her name is Cookie. <BR>She's about 14 weeks old. <BR>Her mother was a Boxer. Her father was a traveling salesman (Tammy's words). Possibly a Pit Bull, but not sure. Very sweet disposition. <P>She was a pound puppy. We adopter her last weekend. <P>We figure she'll be "boxer size" when grown. She's grown visibly in the week that we've had her. Has *huge* feet.<P> <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
