Z||000008||Lady Pegasus||12-09-2001||07:07 PM||||AAWW!!  All the pets are CUTE!!  Wish my scanner was working so I could show off the pics of my pets.  I have a Black lab mix who sleeps in bed with me every night.  Then there's Teddy, my pomeranian/sheltie mix.  He has the best personality in the world.  Then I have FIVE cats...that's right.  We have TWO black cats, a tortie, white persian, and a tabby.  The only ones we paid for was Teddy and my Tabby.  Three of the cats were strays who found their ways into our homes (and hearts), The lab mix was free (one of 13 puppies...mom was TIRED!).  It is hard, I admit.  Seven animals can get under foot...but I wouldn't trade it for the world.  Nothing is better than walking into a house to be greeted by wagging tails and big smiles, and NOTHING is more relaxing than a purring cat on your chest.  I love my aminals.  And they love me, too.  <P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||6
